<title>
ECT Sensor On-Vehicle Inspection
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Before performing this inspection, read “Precautions for ECM Circuit Inspection” under 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0A1000004">Precautions for Engine (K14C)</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</attention3>
<ptxt>
Check that ECT sensor signal is outputted properly. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1114082"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
